# Frontend Rules

## Next.js
- Default to Server Components; add `"use client"` only for interactivity, sockets, editors
- Use `loading.tsx` and Suspense for feed/search routes
- `next/image` for avatars, covers, attachments
- ISR `revalidate: 60` for public community pages

## Layout
- Reuse `AppHeader`, `CommunitySidebar`, `RightRail`, `ThreadCard`, `TagChip`
- 3-column grid on desktop; collapse sidebars on mobile
- Match UI mockups: white cards, subtle borders, red primary buttons

## Data Fetching
- Server Actions or RSC fetch for initial page data
- Client fetch + Socket.io for live counts (comments, reactions, notifications)
- Shared form validation: `@threadsphere/shared` schemas with react-hook-form + zodResolver

## Thread Detail Page
- Required: title, tag chips (1–5), sanitized rich content, comment thread
- Tag chips link to `/search?tag={slug}`
- Left sidebar: community context; right sidebar: author + related
